{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title0.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/GifSteamHorizontal.gif?t=1743026766\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title5.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/gif8.gif?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title6.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/gif6.gif?t=1743026766\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577070?t=1743026766","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577070?t=1743026766","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/3354d1be43f9c5387ddfba28e17e671d6c070f3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743026766","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/3354d1be43f9c5387ddfba28e17e671d6c070f3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743026766","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title0.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use cards to plant and grow seeds to restore life in an apocalyptic world. Unlock and build powerful synergies, confront bosses and discover the history of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/GifSteamHorizontal.gif?t=1743026766\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title5.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different plants have different requirements, shapes and effects. Place them strategically to cover the land taken over by the anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/gif8.gif?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/title6.png?t=1743026766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After successfully restoring nature in each island, different plants and colours will cover the land depending on your deck and play style, changing the final look of the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/extras/gif6.gif?t=1743026766\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a consequence of mistreatment by humans, the Earth deteriorates to its limit causing the appearance of anomalies: unexplainable phenomena in which natural laws are altered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over time, humanity is decimated and transformed, new ways of interpreting the forces of nature emerge, and a deep devotion to flowers arises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The only hope for this new society is that growing plants and caring for the Earth can restore order in the planet.</p>","developers":["Ceiling Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577070/e810f99d1fd629f3ffe1ea823dacbdd763c75803/header.jpg?t=1743026766","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Solace of Flowers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 460<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equiv